{
  "name": "Emboldening Bond (entries)",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/magic/life/heart-cross-strong-flame-green.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As an action, you bond up to a number of willing creatures you can see within 30 feet (yourself included) equal to your Proficiency Bonus, for 10 minutes. While a bonded creature is within 30 feet of another, it can add 1d4 to an attack roll, ability check or saving throw it makes, once a turn. Using the feature again ends the earlier bond.</p><p><em>Automation (midi-qol entries):</em> a bonded creature near another is offered the 1d4 after its roll, once a turn; bonding again ends the earlier bond everywhere.</p>",
      "chatFlavor": ""
    },
